{"parse": {"title": "SK-07", "pageid": 40868, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/SK-06\" title=\"SK-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">SK-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/SK-08\" title=\"SK-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">SK</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.AE.88.E5.A4.9C.E4.BA.BA\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"守夜人\">守夜人</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 守夜人</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The&#160;Night&#160;Keeper</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1860307</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>在我收到了不知道第多少封拒收通知，提交过不知道多少次数据证明之前，我就付不起房租，只能住在研究所了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>而今天，也是我的最后一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>也许是因为我一不小心把最后一枚硬币掉到下水道了，也许是因为我兑水兑了太多次的墨水结成冰了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>也许是因为我真的再也找不到一家能游说的期刊出版社了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>总之那天，我决定，再接到一封拒收信我就真的放弃，但我不知道我还要在这里等多久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>因为有些时候，没有通知就是一种通知。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-307712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-307712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-307712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>唉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌趴在桌子上，一股潮湿的味道迎面而来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>百无聊赖，北方哨歌走到了那块公告栏旁，盘算着如果她离开了，这个厚木板要怎么处理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>瓦莲京娜！信！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>院子里响起了邮差的声音，北方哨歌心底一沉，无奈地坐在桌子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不愿意主动去迎接这件事的到来，但是信会从门缝中飞进来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌机械地剪开了信封，从里面拿出了一张纸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>“非常感谢……很遗憾……祝您一切顺利。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>看到这几个词就知道又被拒绝了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌看着手中的拒收信，油墨光鲜亮丽，一看就知道出自很好的打印机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只需要一眼，北方哨歌就在破旧的研究所里找到了它的同类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-307712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-307712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3e/HeadIconSmall-307712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>是啊，我们祖上也是富过的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌心头燃起了一股无名怒火，她“啪”地一下把拒收信贴在了公告栏上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-307714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>这就是理线学……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌快步走到了座位上，将之前积攒的拒收信一并拿了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>这就是理线学！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“啪！”又是一张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>不是很风光吗！21世纪，不是理线学的时代吗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“啪！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-307710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-307710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-307710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>理线学和量子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-307710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-307710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-307710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>泡温泉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-307710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-307710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-307710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>海洋项目！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌把拒收信都贴在了那些曾经风光的项目公示上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>这些拒收信，都是你们该收的！不该是我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但每张拒收信上都写着“瓦莲京娜”的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌无力地坐在了地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>不该是我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>泪滴滴落在了她手中的拒收信上，那上面早就遍布泪痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>如果没有那些埋头研究的人，理线学不会欣欣向荣起来，但现在专心研究的人寸步难行，纷纷离开……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌攥紧了手中的拒收信，这其中，当然也包含老尼古拉的那两封。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>如果没有那些四处逢迎的人，理线学的名号也不会这么快打响，但他们都锒铛入狱，名声尽毁……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌看着破旧的研究所，早就不是以前那般富丽堂皇、人声鼎沸的景象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>别的学派并非没有学阀欺压的现象，为什么单单是理线学如同纸做的老虎，因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>呵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌心中早有答案，但她说不出口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>所以，对一个学派来说，埋头研究的人没有用，长袖善舞的人也没有用。全都没有用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌颓然地坐在地上，手掌微胀，有一层麻麻的感觉浮在皮肤之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我一个人，怎么可能力挽狂澜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌就这么坐在地上，不管地板的钉子是不是翘起了一角，不管板下的蘑菇是不是已经被自己压碎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不想就这么收拾行李离开，但是除此之外她已经没有别的事情好做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌将头靠在桌子上，仰视着那个公告栏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>理线学的历程……今天……就跟我的学术生涯一起……死在这个破屋子里吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不知道这么看了多久，北方哨歌的眼泪渐渐流不出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>好累……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随着屋内的光线渐渐变暗，她迷迷糊糊地睡了过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮铃铃——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi\"><img alt=\"1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_bg_xiaozhenhuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮铃铃——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌一个激灵，从地上站了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“叮铃铃——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不是错觉，是研究所的电话响了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌快速地擦了擦脸，连忙把电话接了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>喂，您好，请问您是瓦莲京娜女士吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>是我。是期刊的编辑吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌把话筒紧紧贴在耳朵上，她期望事情发生转机。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>不，我是索菲亚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>索菲亚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>记忆回到了雅库特斯克，明明一直在修改这篇论文，但索菲亚的名字已经变得有些陌生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>是的，现在雅库特斯克的气温已经回暖了，我想邀请你来继续我们的研究。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>研究……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌看着这个破败的新研究所，霉菌已经蔓延到了天花板的中央。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你……不知道理线学发生了什么事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像当初的叶莲娜和阿列克谢，北方哨歌也向索菲亚发出了警告。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>我知道，我也察觉到你的论文发表得并不顺利，但我这边一个人进展不下去，所以可以请你过来吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>可是……理线学已经……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>跟理线学发生了什么没有关系吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌犹豫再三，还是说出了自己心中的担忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>如果有理线学的介入，你的魔精保育计划也会被人视为欺诈项目的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>这会妨碍我们的研究吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我……不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>那你快来吧，瓦莲京娜同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你不在乎吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b3/HeadIconSmall-616001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">索菲亚：</div><div>那些事都与研究无关。瓦莲京娜同志，我觉得你的注意力应该放在更有趣的事情上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>理所当然的语气令北方哨歌微微一愣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>索菲亚，你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“我觉得你的注意力应该放在更有趣的事情上。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_at_biewutaqiu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_at_biewutaqiu\"><img alt=\"1_8_at_biewutaqiu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-1_8_at_biewutaqiu.png/600px-Cg-1_8_at_biewutaqiu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-1_8_at_biewutaqiu.png/900px-Cg-1_8_at_biewutaqiu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-1_8_at_biewutaqiu.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_at_biewutaqiu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宛如敲响的圣钟驱散了阴霾，这几个月的酸楚涌来，堵住了北方哨歌的喉头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她紧紧地捧着电话，犹如抱住了这位远方的友人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她怕她放开手，就会失去这份对理线学来说尤为珍贵的接纳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>滴落在积尘的电话桌上的泪水慢慢结成了冰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你说得对。我们……应该在雅库特斯克见面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌的语气平稳。她的手指和小臂一阵酸痛，但还是不愿意减轻自己力度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>雅库特斯克，我的“别洛沃耶”之地，那场让我想要永远沉迷的梦境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我得以继续下去的理线学……它不会在这间屋子里消亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>我不会让它在这间屋子里消亡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>北方哨歌看向贴满了拒收信的公告栏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她突然觉得心底出现了一个新的答案。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "SK-07"}}